      "sourceTextSha256": "eddae6532bc3b6af358f4fe79dd360805f949a9af7abe8732b13b15fa44efc51",
      "text": "This 15-day journey takes you through Brazil, Argentina, Chile and Peru. Begin in Rio de Janeiro with its beaches, Corcovado, Christ the Redeemer and Sugar Loaf Mountain. Then travel to Iguazu to see the falls first from Brazil and then from Argentina.",
